{app_title}
Supported Minecraft versions: {supported}
Primary target: 1.21.1 (DataVersion=3955)

The save version is detected automatically when a world is opened: supported saves use the matching processing logic;
for unsupported saves you choose a supported version (default: the nearest version number).

Implemented with the Python standard library + tkinter/ttk; no network access.
A session.lock exclusive lock prevents writing a save while the game is using it;
every write is backed up first, and backup paths are shown in the status bar.

Features: World Info / Blocks & Block Entities / Block Search / Block Entity Search / Player Data / Mod Data (Curios) / Raw NBT / Verify & Backup.

Mod-data sub-tabs label the supported mod/game/loader versions; version mismatches may cause undefined behavior.
